  interface from the source subtree when no generated copy exists. Convenience
  include groups for Dt, DtI, ToolTalk, Xm, CSA and SPC now apply the same
  build-first/source-second order. Run both C23 CI compiler lanes and the
  installed filesystem integration from empty shadow build directories.
